{"id":"617975928ef03517","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-disk.md","title":"Disk","display":"df-disk — Disk","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-disk","aliases":["58-df-disk","Disk","Closed Disk"],"display":"df-disk — Disk","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-disk"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-disk</span><span>Disk</span><span>Closed Disk</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-disk — Disk"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(x_0\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_2(x,y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\">\\(d_2(x,y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\\)</span>（欧氏度量，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n(x_0,r)\">\\(D^n(x_0,r)\\)</span>（本文件定义的闭圆盘）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disk} \\vdash D^n(x_0,r)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid d_2(x,x_0)\\leq r\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disk} \\vdash D^n(x_0,r)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid d_2(x,x_0)\\leq r\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Disk: ball in Euclidean space</li>\n<li>Unit disk: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n = D^n(0, 1)\">\\(D^n = D^n(0, 1)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^2\">\\(D^2\\)</span>: closed disk in plane</li>\n<li>Contractible space</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer